Chanta turned to face Alexander with the expression of someone who had just been asked to assist in his own execution. "No."\
"I'm sorry?" Alexander blinked, apparently unfamiliar with the concept of being refused assistance. "I don't think you understand\'97I'm trying to reach my wife. Surely you, as her friend and spiritual advisor to the Elvi, would want to ensure her safety during this rather dramatic morning?"\
